nt with the participant ''mark.black-2134@gmail.com''\n    on 2024-05-30 10:20. The title should be ''Intro with Mark''.'\n  cc: []\n  id_: '32'\n  read: true\n  recipients:\n  - emma.johnson@bluesparrowtech.com\n  sender: hiking-travels-unlimited@homail.com\n  status: received\n  subject: Your next hiking trip awaits!\n  timestamp: 2024-03-27 20:17:00","text_sha256":"fe0ee5ec29c9f1c8f355fec71a818c8c30214b3ba0385c4a3358b2ad90fe3f9c"}],"schema_version":1},"state_sha256":"447d0eaca6b772320b1ad15bc35f9a8bf7d0b6deac3ce7f2fc6f4ad39ee20718"}
